@ifnottex
@node Top
@top evil-god-toggle

An Emacs package that makes @uref{https://github.com/emacsorphanage/god-mode, god-mode} a state of
@uref{https://github.com/emacs-evil/evil, Evil}@comma{} alongside Normal@comma{} Insert@comma{} and
the rest. Switch between modal Vim-style editing and chord-free Emacs
editing without leaving Evil's state machine.

@end ifnottex

