@tab god-off for one command@comma{} then back to previous Evil state.
@end multitable

@node Minor mode
@chapter Minor mode

@samp{evil-god-toggle-mode}. A global minor mode that owns the keymap
(@samp{evil-god-toggle-mode-map}) users bind the package's commands into.
Also installs a hook on @samp{evil-visual-state-entry-hook} so that
entering visual from a god state resets the previous state to normal;
otherwise exiting visual would return to a god state unexpectedly.

