@node Entering god
@section Entering god

@itemize
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-execute-in-god-state} (optional prefix arg). Enter
persistent god state from any Evil state. Preserves visual region
per @samp{evil-god-toggle-persist-visual}. Prefix arg moves cursor one
character forward@comma{} useful at end-of-line (god allows the cursor
past the last char@comma{} Evil normal does not).
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-execute-in-god-state-forward}. Same as above@comma{} with
the move-forward behavior baked in.
@end itemize

@node Leaving god
@section Leaving god

@itemize
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-stop-god-state-maybe-visual} (takes
ALTERNATE-TARGET: @samp{normal}@comma{} @samp{insert}@comma{} or @samp{visual}). Exits god and
picks the destination Evil state. If a charwise region is active
and @samp{evil-god-toggle-persist-visual} is @samp{always} or @samp{to-evil}@comma{}
stashes the region and restores visual; otherwise falls back to
ALTERNATE-TARGET@. Recommended entry point for keybindings.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-stop-god-state-maybe-visual-once}. Same for
god-once; consults @samp{evil-god-toggle-persist-visual-once} (falling
back to @samp{-persist-visual} when set to @samp{follow}).
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-stop-execute-in-god-state} (takes TARGET). Bare
transition without visual-persistence logic. Used by the @samp{-maybe-}
variants; prefer those for keybindings.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-bail}. Immediately abort any god state@comma{} strip
transient hooks@comma{} land in Evil normal. Escape hatch.
@end itemize

@node Toggling
@section Toggling

@itemize
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-god-toggle}. If in god@comma{} call
@samp{-execute-in-god-off-state}; otherwise call @samp{-execute-in-god-state}.
One-key flip-flop.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-execute-in-god-off-state} (optional prefix arg).
Enter god-off. Same visual-region handling and prefix-arg
move-forward as @samp{-execute-in-god-state}.
@end itemize

@node One-command variants
@section One-command variants

@itemize
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-once} (optional prefix arg). Enter god-once for
exactly one non-prefix command@comma{} then return to the previous state.
Signals an error if already in god/god-once or in the minibuffer.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-once-forward}. With move-forward.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-off-once} (optional prefix arg). Enter god-off-once
for one command. Signals an error if already in god-off/god-off-once.
@item
@samp{evil-god-toggle-off-once-forward}. With move-forward.
@end itemize

